{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/vectorstoreandrag"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Vector databases are essential for modern semantic search and AI agent knowledge retrieval. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftCluster"},{"text":" provides ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VectorStore"},{"text":", a thread-safe in-memory vector index optimized with Apple Accelerate SIMD operations (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vDSP_dotprD"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vDSP_svesqD"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vDSP_distancesqD"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"1. Creating a VectorStore","anchor":"1-Creating-a-VectorStore","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftCluster","import SwiftNLP","","\/\/ Initialize vector store with Cosine Similarity","let store = VectorStore(metric: .cosineSimilarity)","","\/\/ Generate dense text embeddings","let engine = LocalEmbeddingEngine(dimension: 128)","","let articles = [","    (id: \"art_1\", title: \"Apple Silicon Architecture\", text: \"Unified memory and neural engine overview\"),","    (id: \"art_2\", title: \"Swift Strict Concurrency\", text: \"Data-race safety and Sendable types in Swift 6\"),","    (id: \"art_3\", title: \"Quantum Computing Basics\", text: \"Qubits and superposition principles\")","]","","for art in articles {","    let vec = engine.embed(art.text)","    store.add(id: art.id, vector: vec, metadata: [\"title\": art.title])","}","","print(\"Total indexed vectors: \\(store.count)\")"]},{"type":"heading","text":"2. Top-K Semantic Search","anchor":"2-Top-K-Semantic-Search","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let queryVec = engine.embed(\"How does memory sharing work on M-series chips?\")","let results = store.search(query: queryVec, topK: 2)","","for hit in results {","    print(\"Found ID: \\(hit.id), Score: \\(hit.score), Title: \\(hit.metadata[\"title\"] ?? \"\")\")","}"]},{"type":"heading","text":"3. Supported Metrics","anchor":"3-Supported-Metrics","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cosineSimilarity"}]},{"text":": Ideal for normalized text embeddings (returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[-1.0, 1.0]"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dotProduct"}]},{"text":": Direct inner product for unnormalized projections.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".euclideanDistance"}]},{"text":": Geometric L2 distance for spatial clustering.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides & Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/DimensionalityReduction","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/ClusteringAndOutliers","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWVectorSearch"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials"}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build low-latency semantic search, embedding retrieval, and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines on Apple Silicon using SIMD Accelerate."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Vector Store Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStore","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorSearchResult","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorMetric"],"anchor":"Vector-Store-Types"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":